msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1002
msgid "Could Not Rename Resource"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1003
msgid "An attempt to rename the specified resource <strong>%1</strong> failed."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1011
msgid "Could Not Alter Permissions of Resource"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1012
msgid ""
"An attempt to alter the permissions on the specified resource "
"<strong>%1</strong> failed."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1019
msgid "Could Not Delete Resource"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1020
msgid "An attempt to delete the specified resource <strong>%1</strong> failed."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1027
msgid "Unexpected Program Termination"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1028
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the "
"<strong>%1</strong> protocol has unexpectedly terminated."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1036
msgid "Out of Memory"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1037
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the "
"<strong>%1</strong> protocol could not obtain the memory required to "
"continue."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1045
msgid "Unknown Proxy Host"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1046
msgid ""
"While retrieving information about the specified proxy host, "
"<strong>%1</strong>, an Unknown Host error was encountered. An unknown host "
"error indicates that the requested name could not be located on the Internet."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1050
msgid ""
"There may have been a problem with your network configuration, specifically "
"your proxy's hostname. If you have been accessing the Internet with no "
"problems recently, this is unlikely."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1054
msgid "Double-check your proxy settings and try again."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1059
msgid "Authentication Failed: Method %1 Not Supported"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1061
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Although you may have supplied the correct authentication details, the "
"authentication failed because the method that the server is using is not "
"supported by the KDE program implementing the protocol %1."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1065
msgid ""
"Please file a bug at <a "
"href=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">http://bugs.kde.org/</a> to inform the KDE "
"team of the unsupported authentication method."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1071
msgid "Request Aborted"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1078
msgid "Internal Error in Server"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1079
msgid ""
"The program on the server which provides access to the <strong>%1</strong> "
"protocol has reported an internal error: %0."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1082
msgid ""
"This is most likely to be caused by a bug in the server program. Please "
"consider submitting a full bug report as detailed below."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1085
msgid "Contact the administrator of the server to advise them of the problem."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1087
msgid ""
"If you know who the authors of the server software are, submit the bug "
"report directly to them."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1092
msgid "Timeout Error"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1093
msgid ""
"Although contact was made with the server, a response was not received "
"within the amount of time allocated for the request as "
"follows:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Timeout for establishing a connection: %1 seconds</li>"
"<li>Timeout for receiving a response: %2 seconds</li>"
"<li>Timeout for accessing proxy servers: %3 seconds</li></ul>Please note "
"that you can alter these timeout settings in the KDE Control Center, by "
"selecting Network -> Preferences."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1104
msgid "The server was too busy responding to other requests to respond."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1110
msgid "Unknown Error"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1111
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the "
"<strong>%1</strong> protocol has reported an unknown error: %2."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1119
msgid "Unknown Interruption"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1120
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the "
"<strong>%1</strong> protocol has reported an interruption of an unknown "
"type: %2."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:1128
msgid "Could Not Delete Original File"
